    "description": "Quarry, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Over budget: 274 blocks vs 88 (the flush yard and quarry-floor paving is 70 of them). Flush piece (ground_layer 0: the mod does not support it yet). Cobblestone shed with a spruce gable roof by a gravel yard of cut blocks and a broken-rock quarry floor the quarrymen dig down from (builders never dig); L2 adds the log crane over the cut, the worked rock face, the stonecutter and a tool rack; L3 rubble piles, sign, banner, lanterns, flowers.",
